walkrun1_01_e_66","text":"They lost control of the elevator, and it nearly crashed in the middle of the Ark,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_footstepwalkrun1_01_e_67","type":"Speech","speaker":"doctor","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_footstepwalkrun1_01_e_67","text":"but before it landed, the Nikkes that were onboard blew themselves up to prevent a catastrophe.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_footstepwalkrun1_01_e_68","type":"Speech","speaker":"doctor","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_footstepwalkrun1_01_e_68","text":"It was an incredibly noble thing they did.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_footstepwalkrun1_01_e_69","type":"Speech","speaker":"doctor","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_footstepwalkrun1_01_e_69","text":"People have started referring to this entire incident as The Goddess Fall, and there has been an outpouring of grief for the Nikkes who sacrificed themselves.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_footstepwalkrun1_01_e_70","type":"Speech","speaker":"doctor","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_footstepwalkrun1_01_e_70","text":"It's significantly curtailed the voices of those factions who were so fervently anti-Nikke before.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_footstepwalkrun1_01_e_71","type":"Speech","speaker":"doctor","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_footstepwalkrun1_01_e_71","text":"That program on television is a debate on whether or not to grant Nikkes additional rights.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bg